 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 This is a log of changes that ncurses has gone through since Zeyd started
@@ -46,6 +46,16 @@
 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20260808
+	+ various improvements/fixes to test/dup_field.c
+	+ correct a check for FORM* in test/tracemunch
+	+ correct an ifdef in delscreen when using --enable-reentrant (report
+	  by Vassili Courzakis).
+	+ modify dup_field to allocate buffers needed for wide-character
+	  configuration of dup_field (report by Serhiy Storchaka).
+	+ correct masking of wide characters into chtype in winch (report by
+	  Serhiy Storchaka).
+
 20260801
 	+ use ansi+csr in aaa+dec -TD
 	+ use ansi+idc in hurd, tw100, vt420 -TD
